# Private keys, wherever somebody puts one.
#
# The catalog key lives under %LOCALAPPDATA% and has no business here, but a
# key committed once stays in the history even after it is deleted - and a
# private key in a repository is a published private key, whether or not the
# repository is public today. Cheaper to make it impossible.
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key
